          "text": "The Energy Department Announces Intention to Support Adding 2.5 GW of Grid Capacity and 800 Jobs"
        },
        {
          "start": 1802,
          "end": 2189,
          "text": "“America's electric grid cannot become a roadblock to economic growth,” said Office of Electricity (OE) Assistant Secretary Katie Jereza . “By bringing TVA and local utilities together, we're helping reduce costly outages and deliver more power where it's needed. That means fewer disruptions for families, more opportunities for businesses, and a stronger foundation for American jobs.”"
